person.note:
Deputy Executive Secretary of the Department of State, August 1961-May 1962;
                    thereafter Special Assistant to the Secretary of State and Executive
                    Secretary

Officer in Charge of Cuban Affairs, Office of Caribbean and Mexican Affairs,
                    Bureau of Inter-American Affairs, Department of State until February 1962;
                    Deputy Director, Office of Caribbean and Mexican Affairs, February-June 1962;
                    thereafter Special Assistant for Cuban Affairs, Bureau of Inter-American
                    Affairs; also Project Officer for Operation Mongoose
